title: 'Add Interweb Polkadot WebRTC, TCP and WSS bootnodes'

doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Adds three Interweb IT bootnode multiaddrs to the embedded Polkadot relay
    chainspec (`polkadot/node/service/chain-specs/polkadot.json`), all via DNS
    `boot.interweb-it.com`: WebRTC UDP 13012, TCP 13012, and WSS 13016.
    Peer ID 12D3KooWRjHFApinuqSBjoaDjQHvxwubQSpEVy5hrgC9Smvh92WF.
    No crate API or runtime code changes.

crates:
- name: polkadot-service
  bump: none
